   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "With its cutting-edge design, the Flyer 10 Sport Top is the perfect embodiment of the Flyer range. The elegant shape of its frames plays with light and reinforces its contemporary look. On the upper deck, the seamless layout of space creates a harmonious atmosphere. Thanks to its generous headroom, this model provides a feeling of constant openness, in keeping with the Open boat spirit.",
