   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The Flyer 10 Sport Top features two double berths and a fully equipped bathroom with a separate shower for extended trips. Flooded with natural light through the long hull glazing, the central cabin and mid-cabin provide ample space and plenty of storage. Enhanced by walnut woodwork, the interior atmosphere exudes comfort and sophistication.",
