   "id": "Pilot Edition version",
   "title": "Pilot Edition version",
   "intro": "​​\nWith the PILOT EDITION, the Flyer range reaffirms its style. This special edition stands out thanks to its cutting-edge design and features tailored to enhance your experience at sea:\n- Signal Grey hull\n- Elegant Pilot Edition hull decoration\n- Black lacquered stainless steel aft and stern railings\n- A sporty steering wheel\n- Blue underwater lights\n- Limited edition upholstery",
   "items": [],
   "images": [
